menu "KVMpad language resources"
    config KVM_IME_KOREAN
        bool "Include the Korean keyboard module in firmware flash"
        default y
        help
            Embed the Hangul font in the application. With this option off,
            Korean composition can use font_hangul_24.bin in the ime_data
            partition. Both modes use the built-in two-set composer.
endmenu
